Dialogue: 3,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.43,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(976,0)}The Girl They Called a Devil
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.43,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(976,0)\t(934,976,\1a&H00&)}The Girl They Called a Devil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools braved Aqua\NLaguna to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're determined, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either that or they're just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we have permission\Nto kill this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we kill them, it'll be\Nover before we have any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The drawbridge? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Franky family's trying to\Nget that under control right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they bring it down, we should be\Nable to get to the other side, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right there and\Nall we can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be hiding one hell of a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here are your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill the intruders, but only engage\Nthem here at the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life and my promotion are the\Nmost important things right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be careful about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I let all my underlings run off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's going to protect me\Nif something goes wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:02:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may act tough, but you don't know\Nwhat you're getting yourselves into!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think you can\Nbeat all of CP9, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the Gates of Justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think you can open them, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even then, if things\Ngo wrong, I have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Golden Transponder Snail, giving me\Nthe authority to wish you a Buster Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you remember its power well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it did destroy\Nyour homeland 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it, Ohara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to recall the name since\Nit was wiped off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin's homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nowhere for me to go or return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:04:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, begging for mercy, I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want me to\Npress this and annihilate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all your little friends\Nwith a Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you push that button, do you\Nhave any clue what will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This button will eliminate any chance your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends possibly have of\Nleaving this island alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is one little press.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be more simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think that you\Ndon't understand a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are all those old memories\Ncoming back to you now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should press it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who makes\Nthe demands here, wench?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say Ohara was wiped off the map,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your map doesn't show you the\Nlives of the people who lived there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your view of the world\Nis so distant and so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,twisted that you've lost\Nsight of your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how much you could\Nsacrifice in the name of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call is going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't use it to anything but that.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.07,0:05:50.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,700)\bord3.5\fscx175\fscy175\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(1984,0)\t(1942,1984,\1a&H00&)}Ohara\N{\fnKakumin Web\fscx125\fscy125}20 Years Ago – West Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.07,0:05:50.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,700)\fscx175\fscy175\b600\bord0\c&HFDFDFC&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(1984,0)\t(1942,1984,\1a&H00&)}Ohara\N{\fnKakumin Web\fscx125\fscy125}20 Years Ago – West Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.07,0:05:50.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,700)\fscx175\fscy175\b600\bord0\c&HFDFDFC&\blur0.8\fad(1984,0)}Ohara\N{\fnKakumin Web\fscx125\fscy125}20 Years Ago – West Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice throw! Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,715)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(477,478)\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)\t(2062,2103,\1a&HFF&)}Nico Robin (8 Years Old)
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,715)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE2E5E5&\blur0.8\fad(477,478)}Nico Robin (8 Years Old)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, Monster Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster! Monster! Monster! Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Monster Girls hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My kids came home crying because\Nyou hit them on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, acting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay away from them, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything\Nto say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a little\Nmonster, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done talking with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, Mommy, what are we\Nhaving for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, um, rice omelette!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure like rice omelette, huh? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll pick up some\Neggs on the way home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm home so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aunt Roji?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Robin, today...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you must know, is my\Nlittle girl's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the family is going out\Nfor a special dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left some bread out on the table,\Nso you can eat that for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be too greedy with the jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're done eating, and before we\Ncome back, I want you to do the dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scrub the floors,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take the laundry inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and go straight to bed as soon as\Nyou're finished with your chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, Mommy, what are we\Nhaving for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, um, rice omelet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure like rice omelettes, huh? Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll pick up some\Neggs on the way home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.86,0:09:11.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord2.5\xshad-1\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(477,0)\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)}The Tree of Knowledge\N{\bord3\xshad0}Ohara Library and Archaeological Research Center
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.86,0:09:11.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE5E6E5&\blur0.8\fad(477,0)}The Tree of Knowledge\NOhara Library and Archaeological Research Center
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh look, here comes Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems she's stopping by to return a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in place quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor Clover?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finished the book you lent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.59,0:09:37.26,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,750)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}The Archaeologists of Ohara
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.59,0:09:37.26,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,750)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE2E5E5&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)}The Archaeologists of Ohara
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a cake for you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, that doctoral exam you took the\Nother day, you passed with a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, from this day forward, you\Nare an official archeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you're one of us now, we\Ncan all work on our research together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this proves that you're a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wear it with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks great on you, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so proud.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.25,0:10:13.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,625)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(483,0)\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)}Professor Clover (Authority on Archaeology)\NOhara Library's Head Librarian
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.25,0:10:13.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,625)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE5E6E5&\blur0.8\fad(483,0)}Professor Clover (Authority on Archaeology)\NOhara Library's Head Librarian
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must understand what it means\Nto be an Ohara archeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'm ready to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In particular, it comes from\Nthe past. And this library,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Known as the Tree of Knowledge,\Nit has stood for over 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Collecting countless documents\Nand literature from every corner
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the world This is a treasure\Nfor all humanity to share and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nourish for future generations.\NAs the world's largest library,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowledge is our pride and joy\NUnder the branches of this tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the finest archaeologists\Nfrom every sea have gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this vast wealth of\Ninformation at our disposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no historical\Nmystery that cannot be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to join us? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing\Nyour research take form and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching all the contributions\Nyou will make to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor, what I'd really like is to find\Nout what happened in the blank century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I strictly forbid it just\Nas I always have! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want to solve the\Nmysteries of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't we study the Poneglyphs\Nto find out what happened back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know about all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you use your powers to\Npeek on us in the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any attempt to decipher\Nor study the Poneglyphs is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considered a criminal act\Nby the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you don't tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you study them\Nin the basement at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were spying on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how much do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a very serious matter\Nwe're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if I asked nicely, You\Nstill wouldn't let me join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I studied so hard\Nto become an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I thought then you would\Nfinally treat me like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've studied with all your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And deserve to be called a scholar\Nas much as anyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you're also still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If word gets out, Then every\None of us could be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harsh as that sounds, It's\Nsomething we're willing to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since this became the law\Nof the world 800 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countless scholars have lost their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as many as there are stars in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't stop now,\Nand I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the scholars who ever tried\Nto decipher the ancient texts,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we of Ohara are the only ones\Nwho have met with any success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For us, there is no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on the Tree of Knowledge, if you\Never come close to the basement again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will be forbidden\Nfrom entering the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or conducting research with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this, especially\Nnow, but she's just like her mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before\Nshe uncovers that secret, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her mother, Olvia, was only\Ncaptured by Marines a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's already clear\Nwhat fate she'll suffer.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.50,0:13:31.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\bord3\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1017,0)\t(975,1017,\1a&H00&)}The Following Day
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.50,0:13:31.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\fad(1017,0)\t(0,1017,1,\c&HFDFDFC&)}The Following Day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worms?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.27,0:14:42.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(483,476)\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)\t(3694,3736,\1a&HFF&)}Saul, a Castaway Giant
Dialogue: 2,0:14:38.27,0:14:42.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE5E6E7&\blur0.8\fad(477,476)}Saul, a Castaway Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm still alive after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wonder if she's okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I gotta ask, is there a town or\Nvillage somewhere around here? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:14:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose bakers can't be choosers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a deserted island would\Nhave been nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stare all you want, but ain't\Nnothing gonna happen as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hurt my legs so I'm staying put\Nleast for the time being after I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little better I'll build a raft\Nor something to get me out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this your first time seeing a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missy, yeah. I'll tell you one thing. I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may be as big as those guys from\Nalbath but i sure ain't as mean just
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as sure as there are warlike giants\Nthere's peaceful ones too i know this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a long shot but i gotta ask anyway\Nwhen you get home you think maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could uh not tell anyone that a\Ngiant washed up on the beach okay sure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well that was too easy of course you're\Ngonna tell people i said i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're tellin' a fib.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't no way a kid can\Nkeep a secret this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Derishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It don't mean a darn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way you laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are a funny little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:17:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, all my life people have\Nbeen telling me my laugh is silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, you're pretty\Ncute when you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should do it more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I go by the name Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguar D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saul, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't much know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from what I hear, everyone in my\Nfamily has it for their middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Robin. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, truth is, Robin, some guys\Nare chasing me down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, if someone finds\Nme, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, I wouldn't tell!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.66,0:17:41.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\bord2\xshad-1\yshad1\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\fad(1523,0)\t(1481,1523,\1a&H00&)}Three Days After the Giant Drifted Ashore
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.66,0:17:41.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1523,0)}Three Days After the Giant Drifted Ashore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mighty kind to you, Robin, but\Nyou go ahead and take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach's pretty full as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I caught\Na real Wapol last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get back\Nto work on that raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be done pretty\Nsoon at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to pry, but it seems like you\Nhave an awful lot of time on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I don't like your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been sticking with me for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't your parents and friends\Ngoing to get suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I do have a mom, but she set sail\Nfor work years ago and never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sort of friends with the\Narchaeologists around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they won't let me join in on their\Nresearch, so I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other kids say I'm creepy, so\Neven if I wanted to play with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that they'd let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you have Devil Fruit powers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't scared of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to sail all over the\NGrand Line back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen plenty of folks with\Npowers tougher than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm kind of\Njealous of you little arm thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks pretty handy. Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That laugh of yours is\Nreally weird. Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It don't matter if your laugh's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that really matters is when you laugh,\Nall of a sudden your problems disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you laugh when\Nyou're having fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you're not having fun,\Nall you need to do is laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everything will work out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like you're\Nhaving a tough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're feeling down, just laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing a\Ngood laugh can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems awfully silly\Nto laugh when you're sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't knock until you try it. Here. Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it just like that, and I'll\Nbet you'll feel better in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, with more gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Navy Headquarters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, we're hoping we\Ncan speak to Chief Spandine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now? Ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably just want a status report.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.17,0:20:34.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord2.5\xshad-1\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(477,0)\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)}Somewhere in the West Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.17,0:20:34.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\fad(477,0)}Somewhere {\c&HE8E7E8&}in the West Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll contact them when we see the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.76,0:20:41.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(474,0)\t(432,474,\1a&H00&)}Spandine, CP9 Chief\N(20 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.76,0:20:41.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE5E6E5&\blur0.8\fad(474,0)}Spandine, CP9 Chief\N(20 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.14,0:20:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohara, opera, oh whatever, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they wasting my time making me\Ntrek all the way out here to the West Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with, then\Nget the hell out of this dump.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.39,0:20:52.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\bord2\xshad-1\yshad1\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\fad(1399,0)\t(1358,1399,\1a&H00&)}The Following Day, Four Days After the Giant Drifted Ashore
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.39,0:20:52.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnKakumin Web\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFCFD&\fad(1399,0)}The Following Day, Four Days After the Giant Drifted Ashore
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it true we've got\Na Navy ship on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it must have\Nanchored here overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would the Navy come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird thing is, when people\Nwent to look at the boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they didn't see any Marines there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like a ghost ship, not\Na single person to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now you're just fooling with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor Clover!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's nothing to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just heard that there's a huge\NNavy ship anchored at the seashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better let the other scholars know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The raft is done! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put those puppy dog\Neyes away, little missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I suppose my\Nraft could use a flag, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.28,0:22:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to\Nstay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be darned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're looking to\Nset out to sea too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom's been away from home for years
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks to all her big\Narchaeological research.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whenever she finally\Ncomes back to the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask her to take\Nme along on her next trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.16,0:22:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I've been studying so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my archaeology\Ndoctorate just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a doctorate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tiny little girly like you? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you tell me you don't even\Nremember what your mom's face looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but she's still my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sol.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.26,0:23:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that our\Nworld has a period of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 years that nobody knows\Nanything about? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.02,0:23:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe folks call that the\Nblank century, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious about it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the government says it's\Nillegal for anyone to look into.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I heard my mom is traveling all over\Nthe world investigating it in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that your\Nmom's going around looking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for them ancient stone tablet\Nthings they call poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.94,0:23:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard about poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that ain't the point here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go around\Ntalking about this kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stuff in front of other\Nfolks out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if your mama's out there looking\Nfor them, You especially gotta be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.99,0:23:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, do you happen to\Nknow your mother's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:23:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin is Olvia's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.74,0:24:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so does that mean I've\Nbeen on Ohara all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I end up on O 'Hara of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Nsitting around, Saul?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.58,0:24:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may come as a shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you gotta listen to me and\Nlisten good Navy battleships are on
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their way to O 'Hara right now They\Nmay even be here already The Navy? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to wipe out every\Nlast scholar on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So listen, whatever\Nyou do... You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.52,0:24:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let those government\Nguys know you're a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.07,0:24:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to promise me that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.34,0:24:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop lying to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:24:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.22,0:25:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't joke about\Nsomething this serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to town as quick as you can and\Nsee if anything strange is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy, but\Nyour mom might be there too.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.49,0:25:19.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Nico Olvia\NArchaeologist
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.49,0:25:19.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HE8E7E8&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)}Nico Olvia\N{\c&HE6E6E6&}Archaeologist
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?\NIt's Olvia. You came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard news that you've\Nbeen captured by the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I came back on their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to have to tell you this as soon as\NI return, but the news you heard is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.14,0:25:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.16,0:25:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew the government would set\Nits sights on Ohara eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Poneglyph search team that set off
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.60,0:25:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,six years ago was\Nannihilated by the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty-three researchers were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I was only captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.64,0:25:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I overheard the\NMarines talking after they
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had rummaged through the\Nsearch team's belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.34,0:26:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They soon realized that\Nwe all came from Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't make any excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.56,0:26:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you are in danger because\Nof my carelessness. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinking like that won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.10,0:26:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who set out to sea and those who\Nstayed behind are all part of the same team.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what happened, if anyone\Nshould apologize, it's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know how much you've suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.54,0:26:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For years now, the world government has\Nseen Ohara as a threat to their rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.02,0:26:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all we can do is\Nbelieve in the truth of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.72,0:26:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,history and its value to\Nall generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, they've put us\Nin quite a compromising position.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.24,0:26:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't know how we're\Ngoing to get out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.82,0:26:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it doesn't look good,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're fortunate to have discovered\Nthis information when we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that the government is hunting\Ndown all the scholars on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.12,0:26:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So before they make it to the\Nlibrary, we have to escape from Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.38,0:26:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.22,0:27:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time I have a feeling we won't be\Nable to slip past their investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like we have before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they're committed to killing\Nus, they won't listen to reason either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then hurry up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.38,0:27:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let myself escape and leave one\Nof mankind's greatest treasures behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.26,0:27:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else here feels\Nthe same way. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what the\Ngovernment's gonna do when they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we do know if we run, we can't\Nprotect all this precious knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not planning on dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.30,0:27:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.21,0:27:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, I know you have\Nsomething else weighing on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.52,0:27:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.86,0:27:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind, Olvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to board this ship or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.14,0:27:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to stay with your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.96,0:27:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll settle your husband's\Nunfinished business for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.28,0:27:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a scholar of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my duty to carry out the\Nwill of those who came before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:27:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll solve these mysteries\Nand come back to you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.18,0:28:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.98,0:28:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mom had to go out to sea for her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be staying here with\Nus for a little while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't shut up, I'll hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.18,0:28:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.14,0:28:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.28,0:28:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so is our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I don't care if\Nshe's your sister's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.04,0:28:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.70,0:28:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.06,0:28:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.18,0:28:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to read a book, all\Nyou have to do is ask, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.70,0:28:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't, because I\Ndon't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:29:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, looks like you're in luck because\Nyou can read everything here for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For free? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.52,0:29:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, this library is the best in the\Nworld. It is? Really? Sure is. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.24,0:29:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm mistaken,\Nyou're Olvia's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.30,0:29:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like books? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.84,0:29:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks just like you\Ndid when you were that age.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm proud to say she's\Nevery bit as clever, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's safe, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.06,0:29:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I decided to join you,\NI severed all bonds with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her become the\Ndaughter of a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.26,0:29:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.32,0:29:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another ship came!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the world government's flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.08,0:29:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of their high-ranked officials\Ncoming all the way here to the West Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.29,0:29:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems this is quite serious indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.90,0:29:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, you and I are neither\Ncolleagues nor acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.38,0:29:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stick to that no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.80,0:29:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.02,0:30:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.19,0:30:04.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,750)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Ohara Coastline
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.19,0:30:04.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,750)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFEFFFC&\blur0.8\fad(484,0)}Ohara {\c&HE5E6E6&}Coastline
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.24,0:30:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.24,0:30:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell HQ we've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.12,0:30:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.06,0:30:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.30,0:30:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They better give me a promotion\Nwhen this crap is over. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to hunt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on every sculler on the island\Nand must straighten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.62,0:30:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some woman is running around with a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.82,0:30:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an awful mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.82,0:30:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Robin!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.74,0:30:50.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord2.5\xshad-1\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(480,481)\t(439,480,\1a&H00&)\t(2899,2941,\1a&HFF&)}Somewhere in the West Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.74,0:30:50.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\fad(480,481)}Somewhere {\c&HE8E7E4&}in the West Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.82,0:30:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Kuzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.74,0:30:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.86,0:30:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been informed that CP-9's\NChief Spandine has arrived at Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.14,0:30:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really have to wake me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to tell me that?! I'm sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.59,0:31:01.05,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,675)\fscx150\fscy150\bord3\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(433,0)\t(391,433,\1a&H00&)}Vice Admiral Kuzan, Marine Headquarters\N(Later to Become Admiral Aokiji)
